    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713000/extras/166212e77238226aff0b3f97e1988677.avif?t=1749548949\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u300a</i>\u00a0Whimsy Bake\uff06Craft\u300bis a relaxing and therapeutic idle game. Befriend adorable companions in a charming town, set up automated baking production lines, and Aim to collect all the furniture illustrations and build your own cozy home~!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713000/extras/0245dad5eba7940c426ebcc049bed0ae.avif?t=1749548949\" width=605 height=276 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet charming pixel companions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a personalized cottage that reflects your style!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automated baking process integrated with farming and fishing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor food price fluctuations to maximize profits!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete residents' orders and upgrade the baking hut!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover delightful interactive furniture surprises!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713000/extras/f4c227e984754913c626b031fda28ca1.avif?t=1749548949\" width=326 height=276 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713000/extras/166212e77238226aff0b3f97e1988677.avif?t=1749548949\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u300a</i>\u00a0Whimsy Bake\uff06Craft\u300bis a relaxing and therapeutic idle game. Befriend adorable companions in a charming town, set up automated baking production lines, and Aim to collect all the furniture illustrations and build your own cozy home~!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713000/extras/0245dad5eba7940c426ebcc049bed0ae.avif?t=1749548949\" width=605 height=276 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet charming pixel companions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a personalized cottage that reflects your style!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automated baking process integrated with farming and fishing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor food price fluctuations to maximize profits!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete residents' orders and upgrade the baking hut!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover delightful interactive furniture surprises!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713000/extras/f4c227e984754913c626b031fda28ca1.avif?t=1749548949\" width=326 height=276 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "\u300a\u00a0Whimsy Bake\uff06Craft\u300b is a relaxing and therapeutic idle game where you can craft adorable desserts while freely designing your home\u2019s aesthetics. Embark on this sweet dual-healing journey to enjoy the perfect blend of creativity and cozy charm!",
